WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:25.730
Congratulations, Domon.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.480
You're the champion
of the Gundam Fight.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:40.570
These flames shall
burn away my tears.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.580
This time it's truly goodbye.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.960
That's right!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.170
Cry, Fuun Saiki!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.550
These are the last tears
we'll ever shed for Master!

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:05.890
This sorrowful battle
between Master and Domon...

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.980
...marks the end of one
chapter in the story.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.810
However, the story
does not end here.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:11.810
That's right.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.610
Another Fight is on the horizon...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.610
...that will involve
the whole universe.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.910
It appears that my job
here is not over yet.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.240
And now!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.370
Gundam Fight!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.650
Ready! Go!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:33.080
Rain's Crisis!
Return of the Devil Gundam

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.300
Come on! Hurry up, Grandpa!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.300
Domon's victory ceremony's
about to start!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.100
There's no hurry.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.310
We've got the wind now,
so we'll make good time.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.930
And it's such a beautiful day.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:52.980
You just don't understand.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.320
Mr. Wind! Mr. Wind!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.610
Please blow stronger!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.110
Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.820
We'll be late for
the victory parade!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.160
Domon walked off with my dream.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.450
The Shaolin Temple will
not be resurrected.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.830
And yet...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.210
...in an odd way, I feel
refreshed by all of this.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.280
We had some great matches.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.540
Yeah.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.590
I'm sure my friends
will understand.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.730
She should be okay.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.890
She's out of danger.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:35.390
I've gotten rid of all the DG cells.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.850
Now she just has to rest.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:40.690
Rain...

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:46.660
Domon...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.830
You won it all.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.200
That's right.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.290
He beat the Devil Gundam...

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.290
...and Master, too.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.580
Right.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.590
He happened to be Domon's
very own teacher.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.220
Dr. Mikamura.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.430
We've come to get you.

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:09.260
To get me?

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.470
Why's the Gundam
Fight important?!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.830
Why call it an ideal war?!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.580
What is there to gain from victory?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.830
It's all just a game!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.630
Master's absolutely right.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.000
What is this Gundam
Fight, anyway?

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.470
What did we Fighters
gain over the past year?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.340
Domon!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.340
Congratulations on your victory!

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:53.980
You earned Neo Japan the
right to rule the universe!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:54.680
Yes!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:58.650
It's the first ever Gundam-of-
Gundams title for our nation.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.360
For the next four years...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.230
I don't care about that.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.240
Oh, of course.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.100
I will drop all charges
against your father at once.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:14.290
Now both you and I have
achieved our objectives.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.410
Yes, I shall now...

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.210
Wh-where're you going?!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.990
The ceremony's about to start!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.840
Shut up!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.460
I thought I was free now.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.300
Or should I abandon
the victory as well?!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.300
Wh-what? Don't
be ridiculous!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.930
Hey, Domon!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.350
Ms. Akino! What's
going on here?!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.990
That would be our mobile fleet.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.070
But who gave orders to
mobilize our forces?

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:00.790
Rain...

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.340
It's over, Rain.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.550
It's over. Wait for me.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.460
I'm coming for you!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.850
These are...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:17.990
Rain!

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:18.890
Rain!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.850
Rain!

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.310
Hey, Rain!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.320
Rain!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.030
Rain!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.240
D-Domon...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.030
A-Allenby!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.950
So you made it, Allenby.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:36.700
Domon...

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.450
It's all right.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.290
It'll be all right now.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.610
I fought against Rain.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:44.210
What?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.670
DG cells controlled me.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.170
And the Berserker
System made me crazy.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.180
You mean Rain was the
pilot of Rising Gundam?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.890
So Rain saved you?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:57.890
Yeah.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.180
Rain... Where is Rain now?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:01.690
Well...

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.440
She said she'll
never see you again.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.690
What?!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:27.750
What?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.830
Major Ulube's orders?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:30.720
Yes.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.630
It's too dangerous to leave
that thing here on Earth.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:35.550
So, the plan is to take
it back to the Colony...

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.470
...and start over again, developing
it for military purposes.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.480
That's why he needed you.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.140
Don't worry.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:46.970
I will do what I have to to
eliminate the Devil Gundam.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.440
By the way, are
you okay with this?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.950
I've already made my decision.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.410
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.870
All because of me.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.250
Actually, I'm doing
this for myself.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.380
That's right, Domon...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.670
I'm returning to the
Colony with Father.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:13.680
I don't expect to
see you ever again.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.840
This is crazy!

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.340
You see...

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.470
It was because of my own father...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.810
...that you had to suffer by being
forced to become a Gundam Fighter.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:23.850
That's right.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.770
It's all my father's fault.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.650
And...

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.820
...Father's crimes are,
in turn, my crimes.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.820
Goodbye, Domon.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:31.940
Rain!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.900
Don't go! Rain!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.700
Rain...

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.200
Rain!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.250
Don't come after me. Please.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.710
Rain!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.500
Well, well.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.670
Father and daughter.

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.160
Let me through!
Let me through!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.640
What do you think you're doing?!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.640
This area is under the
control of Neo Japan.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.600
But I'm Domon Kasshu.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.610
No one's allowed past here
without authorization.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.730
Move!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.150
Freeze!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.820
Proceed any further...

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:14.650
Wh-what?

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.680
Wh-what's that?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.220
Domon!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.720
What's going on here?

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.560
Are they taking
the Devil Gundam?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.940
But that's such a
high-handed approach.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.370
What's the deal?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:55.990
Rain...

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.900
Why did you have to go?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.330
You see...

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.840
I need you, Rain.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.520
I'm sorry.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:37.280
Well, good work.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.990
So, this is Wong's report.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:47.500
I never thought he'd done this
much research on the Devil Gundam.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.870
"What is needed for the life unit...

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.960
...is a healthy human
with the power of life."

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:54.960
I see.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.270
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.530
What's wrong with Domon?

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.240
Yeah. He's been like
that for a while now.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.830
He lost his master and the
love of his life all at once.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.210
Can't blame him.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.500
What's Rain thinking,
leaving on her own like this?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.710
Yeah.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.500
But at the same time...

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.720
...we can't stick around
this place forever, either.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.470
Right...

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.050
I guess we have to
return to our nations.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.680
Domon...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.440
Rain forgot to take this.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.480
Her brain wave gadget.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.770
It's of no use now.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.740
Hey! This isn't like you!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.450
If you like Rain so much,
you should go after her!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.950
That's right! That's right!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.160
It's not as simple as that.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.700
Where are you going?!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:13.710
To see how Allenby's doing.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.040
If I went after her...

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.130
...it'd make things more difficult...

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.130
...for Rain.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:29.810
You resign?

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.140
That's correct.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:35.270
Has something given you
cold feet all of a sudden?

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:36.600
No.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.770
My daughter has awakened
me to the reality.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.280
I can't have that.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.740
It would completely ruin my plan.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.240
Your plan?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.700
What more do you want to do?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.790
The Devil Gundam's
been destroyed.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.500
Will you put your petty
ambitions to rest?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.620
I have found what I need.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.960
A new unit to pilot it.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.460
What do you mean?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.460
It's the conclusion
that Wong came to.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.300
The most suitable life
unit is one who is...

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.430
...healthy and possesses
the power of life.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.510
In other words...

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.100
...one who is strong enough...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.640
...to give birth to
the next generation.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.140
You don't mean...!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.730
Rain?!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.400
Run! Rain!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.860
Father?

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.320
Hurry. Get out of here.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.780
But why, Father?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:32.790
The one who's most suitable
as the life unit...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.540
...is one at the top of
all living things...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.420
...who continues to give birth
to increase the numbers.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.880
You see, it requires a woman.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.800
Stop it!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.630
How're you feeling?

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.050
Much better.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.260
What's wrong?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.220
Aren't you going after Rain?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.390
You say that, too?

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:59.850
It's because I know she's the
most important person to you!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.360
Even if I feel it...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.740
She doesn't need me.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.490
Rain...

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.740
Domon!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.290
Wh-what was that?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.510
Rain...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.090
Now!

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.050
Here is your new life!

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:34.350
You shall awaken!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.720
Devil Gundam!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.400
That's right.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.190
That's good.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.320
This is the moment of the true
resurrection of the Devil Gundam!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.380
Hey! Old man!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.540
Old man!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.760
Domon...
Hasn't Domon returned yet?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.260
N-no, he hasn't yet.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.720
Bro!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.180
Where's Bro?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.560
Hey!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.930
Did you guys hear it, too?!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.020
Yeah.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.400
I heard it while recovering
our Gundam from Lantau Island.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.860
Nastasha's checking the
source of the transmission.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.680
What's Domon doing
at a time like this?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.740
There he is!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.240
You fool! Hurry up!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.700
Rain's in danger!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.450
What?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.080
<i>Please, Domon</i>...

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.250
Who is it?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.080
Who's calling me?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:46.790
Please.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.630
Rescue Rain.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.970
Please, Domon Kasshu.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.680
That's Dr. Mikamura.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.640
If he has his way...

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:03.390
...Ulube will take Rain and
the Devil Gundam and...

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.690
What's that?!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.110
Hey! Are you there?!

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:08.440
Dr. Mikamura! Hey!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.700
The man won't give
up. Where did he go?

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.460
I've lost it.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.540
Go and save her.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.920
Rain's waiting for you.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:33.510
If you still can't decide, I'll
go get Rain and make her mine!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:35.720
But I...

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.250
Please don't come after me.

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:40.820
Father's crimes are,
in turn, my crimes.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.640
I can never see you again.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.190
That's right.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.610
I no longer have a
reason to see Rain.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.940
Why?!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.960
Why should you need a reason
to see the one you love?!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.110
Sai Saici...

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:59.530
Isn't it just your indecisiveness
that's holding you back?!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.330
Aren't you the one who's
pushing Rain away?!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.580
Me?

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.170
Am I wrong?!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.000
Isn't that it?!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.340
Sai Saici...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.500
It's as the kid says.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.590
Who cares about the reason?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:16.470
You should risk it all
for that special woman.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.060
That is the destiny of a man.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.310
Right!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.690
I get it, you guys.

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.030
My victories were in the
name of your friendship...

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.650
...and for the one woman
who's always supported me!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.200
Now that I know this...

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.410
...I will grasp a bright
future for both of us!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:41.620
Yeah!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.620
Here I go!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.040
Gundam!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.040
Goodbye, Domon!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.210
Never ever let go of Rain again!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.590
Best of luck.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.510
You're no longer a wander bug.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.170
You're as large as life itself.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.140
Just wait for me, Rain!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.300
I'm gonna get you now!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.890
Come, carrier!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.610
Wh-what's happening?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.690
Okay, I can break through
the atmosphere with this!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.150
I won't let you!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.030
What is this?!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.160
It's one of the Four
Kings, Walter Gundam!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.750
But who's in that Gundam?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.630
It's me.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.290
Have you forgotten?

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:19.170
I was dethroned as world
leader all because of you.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.550
That's right.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.390
It's Wong Yunfat!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.430
That body! Could he have...?!

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.050
Exactly.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:33.480
I have acquired the
power of the DG cells...

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.730
...and now I am to be
known as "Wong the Great"!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:42.820
I won't let you escape into space.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:46.120
The fact is, the Devil
Gundam belongs to me!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.040
What?!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:50.080
You mean the Devil Gundam
has been resurrected?!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.750
Yes, it has.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.920
Whoever the hell did it...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.790
...he used a woman for the
life unit just as I intended.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.250
Could it be Rain?!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:00.800
That's right.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.550
I can feel it! I can feel it!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:06.470
This time the Devil Gundam
has truly been resurrected!

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.890
Why, you!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.640
Shut up!

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:12.690
No!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.440
The carrier!

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.450
Fall!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.490
Fall and get smashed to bits!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:27.280
At this rate, I'll
crash into the ground!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.790
Domon!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.080
Master?!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.170
Right. I get it.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:44.430
I'll be right there, Devil Gundam!

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.930
This time I'll use your powers...

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.260
...to rule Neo Hong Kong again!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:52.060
Better yet... I'll rule
the entire universe!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.890
Not so fast!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.610
Wong!

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.030
You don't have what it
takes to be a Fighter!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.860
It's impossible for
you to defeat me!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.820
Let's do it, Fuun Saiki!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.880
Anyone who tries to
thwart another's love...

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.760
...shall be sent to hell by
the hooves of this horse!

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.060
Erupting...

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.270
...God Finger!

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:47.200
In any case, you guys are finished.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:51.240
The Devil Gundam's desire to
annihilate humanity is still alive.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.200
Shut your mouth!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:01.960
Now...

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.760
...no one's in our way.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.370
Let's go! Fuun Saiki!

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:09.930
I'll be right there!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:14.100
Rain!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:28.490
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:30.990
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:36.290
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:38.830
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:43.960
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.630
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:54.350
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.600 --> 00:23:01.900
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:06.440
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:10.030
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:17.500
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:26.340
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:35.760
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.430
We have a serious problem!

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.310
Ulube declares war on
the colony nations...

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:42.850
...as the Devil Gundam
commences its attack!

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:46.110
Domon struggles against it in
his attempt to rescue Rain.

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:50.320
But just then, his friends
arrive to lend a hand.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.360
Next, on Mobile
Fighter G Gundam...

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:57.040
Devil Colony activated! Attack of the Shuffle Alliance.

00:23:54.570 --> 00:24:01.050
Devil Colony Activated!
Attack of the Shuffle Alliance

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.370
Ready! Go!
